- [x] Implement dynamic head tags (`react-helmet-async`) (2026-08-11) — update `<title>`, `<meta name="description">`, `<meta property="og:title">`, `<meta property="og:description">`, `<meta property="og:url">`, and `<link rel="canonical">` dynamically on section changes via `src/components/SEO.tsx`.
- [x] Convert canvas navigation buttons to semantic anchor tags (`<a href="...">`) (2026-08-11) — replace internal `<button onClick>` calls with `<a href="...">` tags so search crawlers can discover sub-routes through the DOM link graph.
