- [x] Generate `public/sitemap.xml` & update `public/robots.txt` (2026-08-11) — generated XML sitemap listing all 10 section routes and added `Sitemap: https://ohya.sh/sitemap.xml` to robots.txt.
- [x] Fix heading hierarchy (`<h1>` tag duplication) (2026-08-11) — refactored `SectionRenderer.tsx` and section components so that only the active view renders an `<h1>` element, eliminating 10 concurrent `<h1>` tags on the DOM tree.
- [x] Embed Schema.org JSON-LD structured data (2026-08-11) — embedded `Person`, `ProfilePage`, and `BreadcrumbList` JSON-LD scripts for Google Knowledge Panel and Rich Results.
- [x] Image optimization & Core Web Vitals (CLS) (2026-08-11) — added explicit `width` and `height` attributes and native `loading="lazy"` to profile and story images.
- [x] Fix GitHub Pages HTTP 404 SPA fallback — added static site pre-rendering (`scripts/prerender.js` + `npm run postbuild`) so `/`, `/work`, `/personal`, `/projects`, `/keto`, `/now`, `/contact`, `/hobbies`, `/travel`, `/ataco` return `HTTP 200 OK` static HTML with `<h1>` tags and full markup instead of an empty JS shell. (2026-08-11)

